      ],
      "content": "BOVINGDON              \tCHIPPERFIELD ROAD TL 00 SW \t\t\t\t\t(North side)                                        6/9                                    \t\tWest Barn at -                                       \tStreet Farm (on                                        \t\troadside 15m to                                        \t\tS of house) GV                                     \t\tII Barn. C16, altered to outhouse in C19. Timber frame dark weatherboarded with steep red tile roof to road on S but brick infill to frame on N to courtyard. Tall 3-bays barn with clasped-purlin roof with wind braces, and curved braces to tie-beams and wallplate. Former prison cell door re-used on N. Included for group value. Listing NGR: TL0260203091"
    }
